<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Kyoto Guide: 12 places – Fushimi Inari, Higashiyama, Arashiyama &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Fushimi Inari Taisha</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come at sunrise and walk higher than most – it gets emptier at the top. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>135.77971,34.96752,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Higashiyama</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come before 8 a.m. – then the lanes are empty and the light is soft. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>135.77646,34.99709,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Kiyomizu-dera</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go early in the morning or at evening illumination – by day it is crowded. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>135.78444,34.9943,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Gion &amp; Hanamikōji</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come at dusk and heed the signs in the private lanes. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>135.7784,35.00469,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Arashiyama – bamboo grove &amp; Tenryū-ji</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come before 8 a.m. and combine it with the temple of the 1,200 stone figures. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>135.67115,35.01674,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Kinkaku-ji – the Golden Pavilion</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come at opening – later people queue. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>135.72954,35.03953,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Philosopher’s Path &amp; Ginkaku-ji</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Start at Ginkaku-ji early and walk south. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>135.79607,35.01717,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Nishiki Market – Kyoto’s kitchen</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning and eat at the stall. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>135.76557,35.00502,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Temple of 1,200 stone figures (Otagi Nenbutsu-ji)</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>135.66123,35.03116,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Nijō Castle – the nightingale floors</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Get an audio guide and come right at opening. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>135.74854,35.01401,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Kurama–Kibune – mountain hike</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Start in Kurama and eat lunch in Kibune. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>135.76425,35.12259,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Ōhara &amp; Sanzen-in</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Go early and eat lunch there. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/kyoto/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>135.83492,35.11964,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
